  "details": "When hovering with the cursor over a pickup, a blue outline is shown in the shape of the attached collider.\n\nWhen you change the collider (by enabling a different one and disabling the current one), the selection area changes accordingly, but the blue outline still stays the same.\n\nThis is an issue for any pickup that can change the shape (e.g. a book that can be either open or closed), because the outline looks wrong then and cannot be adjusted by us changing the active collider, even though the area in which you can select the pickup is changing accordingly. \n\nThis results in a weird situation where you can select the pickup in a different area than the outline shows.\n\nThe attached image shows the problem that the original shape doesn't match the pickup shape anymore and we cannot adjust the outline at runtime to correct that:",
